-You want to race me?
I'll race you.

00:08:26.601 --> 00:08:29.033
[ Cheering and applause ]
-You want to race?

00:08:29.033 --> 00:08:30.467
Where do we go,
from here to The Roots?

00:08:30.467 --> 00:08:32.067
♪♪

00:08:32.067 --> 00:08:34.367
-To the drums?
-Alright, we'll go here
to the drums.

00:08:34.367 --> 00:08:35.434
You don't even know
your way around.

00:08:35.434 --> 00:08:36.501
There's dresser drawers
right there

00:08:36.501 --> 00:08:38.133
and stuff.
Be careful.

00:08:38.133 --> 00:08:39.601
Wait. Are you getting
a head start?

00:08:39.601 --> 00:08:40.567
-Why is there a flashlight
back here?

00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:42.367
-Oh, that not a flashlight.

00:08:42.367 --> 00:08:43.300
-I don't know what that is.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:44.234
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:08:44.234 --> 00:08:45.767
Whoa. Be careful.

00:08:45.767 --> 00:08:47.601
[ Laughter ]
Alright. That's a lightsaber.

00:08:47.601 --> 00:08:48.968
Alright, you ready for this?
-I didn't stretch.

00:08:48.968 --> 00:08:52.734
-On your mark, get set, go.

00:08:52.734 --> 00:08:55.701
♪♪
[ Cheering ]

00:08:55.701 --> 00:09:03.334
♪♪

00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:04.234
Both times.

00:09:04.234 --> 00:09:05.667
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.667 --> 00:09:07.300
Shawn Mendes, everybody.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.601
I'm winded.

00:09:08.601 --> 00:09:10.133
[ Cheering and applause ]
Shawn's performing his new song,

00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:12.100
"When You're Gone"
later in the show.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.234
For tickets
for Wonder: The World Tour,

00:09:14.234 --> 00:09:16.601
they're on sale right now.
Jesse Tyler Ferguson

00:09:16.601 --> 00:09:18.300
joins us after the break.
Stick around.

